(5200, '2026-01-21 00:00:00', '2026-01-22 16:55:06', 110, '1.) Improved the UI of the leave cards in the \"Apply Leave\" and \"Leave List\" sections, highlighting the remaining leave.\r\n2.) Date Range Restriction: Implemented a restriction in the date range picker so that each employee can apply for leave for a maximum of one month at a time, preventing overlapping or invalid leave requests.\r\n3.) Job Edit Functionality: Developed the complete \"Job Edit\" feature, allowing users to update job details efficiently with proper validation and UI consistency.\r\n4.) Job Delete Functionality: Added the \"Job Delete\" feature, including a new database column to support soft deletes, ensuring deleted jobs can be restored if needed.\r\n5.) Email Notification Fix: Resolved issues that were preventing emails from being sent when a leave was applied or approved, ensuring proper notifications reach the concerned employees.', '09:42', '18:38', '08:56', 116),
(5201, '2026-01-22 00:00:00', '2026-01-22 16:56:17', 110, '1.) Implemented the â€œRemember Meâ€ functionality on the Admin Login, allowing admins to stay logged in after authentication.\r\n2.) Implemented the same â€œRemember Meâ€ feature on the Employee Login for all login fields including Employee ID, Email, and Phone Number.\r\n3.) Made all breadcrumbs in the Settings master dynamic for better navigation and user experience.\r\n4.) Fixed the AJAX error in the Apply Leave module, which was preventing the leave table from displaying properly. Now all leave records load dynamically without errors.\r\n5.) Updated the Edit Leave functionality to properly update applied leave records, ensuring all changes reflect correctly in the database.\r\n6.) Enhanced the Leave Apply and Draft Leave modules to allow Emergency Leave to be applied on the same day.\r\n7.) Added all required validations to ensure proper data handling and prevent errors.', '09:40', '18:32', '08:52', 116),
