(5384, '2026-02-22 00:00:00', '2026-03-02 15:12:40', 67, '1.) Installed the new Result Project and uploaded the complete code to Git.\r\n2.) Tested the Result module and verified that it is working correctly.\r\n3.) Created the Class table using migration and developed the Class model.\r\n4.) Implemented Create, Edit, Delete, and List functionality for Class with AJAX-based listing.\r\n5.) Removed the existing Chosen plugin from the NIMT module.\r\n6.) Created the Stream table using migration and developed the Stream model.\r\n7.) Implemented Create, Edit, Delete, and List functionality for Stream using AJAX.', '09:35', '18:35', '09:00', 116),
(5385, '2026-02-24 00:00:00', '2026-03-02 15:14:00', 67, '1.) Created the Subject table in the database to store all subject-related information.\r\n2.) Implemented functionality to create subjects sequentially based on the selected class and stream.\r\n3.) Developed AJAX-based Create, Edit, and List views for subjects to improve user experience and reduce page reloads.a\r\n4.) Added Class and Stream filters on the subject list page, allowing users to filter subjects dynamically.\r\n5.) Created the Student table according to documentation and added all necessary fields in the migration.\r\n6.) Built AJAX-powered Create, List, Edit, and Delete functionalities for students for seamless operations.', '09:35', '18:35', '09:00', 116),
(5386, '2026-02-25 00:00:00', '2026-03-02 15:15:44', 67, '1.) Began implementing the student result creation feature.\r\n2.) Created the database table for storing results.\r\n3.) Tested with sample result data and implemented the required logic.\r\n4.)When a studentâ€™s enrollment number is selected, all related details auto-fill, including Student Name, Father Name, Mother Name, School Name, Date of Birth, Year of Admission, Examination Year, Class, Stream, and Roll Number.\r\n5.) Related subjects for the selected class and stream are displayed automatically.\r\n6.) Random marks are generated for each subject between 75% and 95%.\r\n7.) Validation ensures that marks do not exceed the maximum set during subject creation and cannot be negative.\r\n8.) Obtained marks are calculated automatically at runtime.\r\n9.) Updated previous code, fixed errors in models and relationships to ensure proper functionality.\r\n10.) Currently, all fields and data are displaying correctly in the form, but results are not yet saving; creation of results is still not working.', '09:40', '18:40', '09:00', 116);
INSERT INTO `dailyreport` (`report_ID`, `DrEntryDate`, `CreationDate`, `ProjectID`, `WorkDescription`, `StartingTime`, `EndingTime`, `TotalHours`, `EmpId`) VALUES
(5387, '2026-02-26 00:00:00', '2026-03-02 15:17:36', 100, '1.) Updated the Frontend Front Page layout as per the shared reference design and requirements.\r\n2.) Reduced excessive informational content on the Front Page to improve clarity and user experience.\r\n3.) Implemented the Brochure Download option on the Front Page.\r\n4.) Modified the Application Form â€“ Quota Code section to display only quota categories (General, OBC, SC, ST, etc.).\r\n5.) Removed pricing and discount details from the Quota Code field on the frontend.\r\n6.) Implemented automatic fee fetching based on the selected quota during the payment process.\r\n7.) Tested frontend changes to ensure proper quota selection and payment amount calculation.\r\n8.) Fixed the issue in the Admin Panel where applicant form details were not visible.\r\n9.) Enabled display of uploaded applicant documents in the Admin Panel.', '11:20', '18:40', '07:20', 116),
(5388, '2026-02-27 00:00:00', '2026-03-02 15:21:41', 67, '1.) Implemented creation of student results; new results are now being saved successfully in the database.             2.) Applied the same logic to the edit functionality, allowing existing results to be updated correctly.\r\n3.) Implemented the delete feature, enabling removal of student results from the system.\r\n4.) Ensured AJAX-based listing reflects create, edit, and delete actions dynamically without page reload.', '13:10', '17:00', '03:50', 116),
(5389, '2026-02-27 00:00:00', '2026-03-02 15:21:41', 614, '1.) Added Migration Certificate UI in the Result View module.\r\n2.) Added Diploma Certificate UI in the Result View module.\r\n3.) Updated and improved the Result section UI layout.\r\n4.) Added footer with official stamp in Result, Migration, and Diploma certificates.\r\n5.) Fixed print layout issues to ensure UI does not break during printing.', '17:00', '20:00', '03:00', 116),
(5390, '2026-02-28 00:00:00', '2026-03-02 15:26:15', 614, '1.) Made the Migration Certificate UI dynamic in the Result View module.\r\n2.) Made the Diploma Certificate UI dynamic in the Result View module.\r\n3.) Converted the Result section data display from static to dynamic.\r\n4.) Added a dynamic footer with official stamp in Result, Migration, and Diploma certificates.\r\n5.) Fixed print layout issues to prevent UI break during printing.', '12:15', '14:00', '01:45', 116),
(5391, '2026-02-28 00:00:00', '2026-03-02 15:26:15', 67, '1.) Updated the Result view to match the NIMT design while keeping it consistent with the existing layout.\r\n2.) Corrected all elements in the print view for proper display.\r\n3.) Removed the Course and Stream fields from the Result view as they were no longer needed.\r\n4.) Made all remaining fields in the Result view fully dynamic.\r\n5.) Added functionality to delete a Result directly from the interface.\r\n6.) Fixed the subject loading issue in the Result module to ensure subjects appear correctly.\r\n7.) Verified that the Result creation, edit, and print features work seamlessly with dynamic data.\r\n8.) Ensured overall UI consistency and smooth functionality across the Result module.\r\n9.) Enabled Result viewing functionality on the frontend, allowing users/students to access results directly from the website.', '14:00', '20:00', '06:00', 116),
