(5625, '2026-05-15 00:00:00', '2026-05-24 17:52:56', 57, '1.) Performed complete testing of the SIS system across all modules including Admin, Candidate, Employer, Associate Partner, and Employee flows.\r\n2.) Verified the full end-to-end process starting from candidate application to employee conversion.\r\n3.) Checked all role-based workflows and ensured proper transitions between different user stages.\r\n4.) Attended the SIS meeting and discussed the complete system flow in detail.\r\n5.) Explained and reviewed the overall workflow structure with the team during the meeting.\r\n6.) Created a detailed workflow diagram covering the entire SIS process.\r\n7.) Prepared a complete Word document explaining the full system workflow step-by-step.\r\n8.) Documented the end-to-end process to ensure clarity for future reference and development.', '09:40', '15:30', '05:50', 116),
