(5890, '2026-06-29 00:00:00', '2026-06-29 13:34:10', 615, '1. Added active user validation to prevent inactive/pending users from scanning coupons.\r\n2. Updated dealer scan limit to allow scans from **5 unique dealers** only.\r\n3. Blocked duplicate scans from the same dealer for the same master coupon.\r\n4. Prevented duplicate scans of the same QR code by the same user.\r\n5. Enforced scan limits based on unique dealer/electrician count.\r\n6. Added proper limit reached response: **\"Coupon Already Scanned!\"**\r\n7. Implemented transaction locking to prevent concurrent scan limit breaches.\r\n8. Marked QR codes as redeemed after a successful electrician scan.\r\n9. Saved redemption details (`is_redeemed`, `redeemed_by`, `redeemed_at`).\r\n10. Updated redeemed QR status to **EXPIRY**.\r\n11. Blocked future scans for already redeemed QR codes.\r\n12. Added response for redeemed QR: **\"This QR code has already been scanned.\"**\r\n13. Improved coupon status validation for accurate redeemed/expired responses.\r\n14. Added validation for inactive/non-published coupons: **\"This coupon is not active.\"**\r\n15. Updated remaining scan calculation based on unique users.\r\n16. Returned `0` remaining scans if the current user has already scanned.\r\n17. Kept wallet credit flow unchangedâ€”credited only after a successful scan.\r\n18. Included unique user statistics in the scan response.\r\n19. Final rule: Once a QR code is redeemed by an electrician, it cannot be used by any other user.', '09:58', '19:10', '09:12', 101),
