(6250, '2026-08-01 00:00:00', '2026-08-03 16:14:03', 59, '1. Checked the Vendor Panel and Admin Panel. Both login portals were not working, so I informed Aditya about the issue.\r\n2. Added notification messages across the entire Vendor Panel for all major actions, including login, create, update, delete, validation, and error handling.\r\n3. Implemented notifications in all Vendor Panel modules, including Services, Packages, Profile, and Promotional Packages.\r\n4. Updated the Vendor Create Form to load all categories dynamically from the Admin Panel.\r\n5. Displayed all categories dynamically in the Customer Panel.\r\n6. Fixed UI issues in the Customer Panel.\r\n7. Attended an internal team meeting.', '09:32', '18:52', '09:20', 116),
(6251, '2026-08-03 00:00:00', '2026-08-03 16:14:58', 59, '1.) Verified the complete Customer Panel on the live environment (eventstan.com) and checked all functionalities.\r\n2.) Verified the complete Vendor Panel on the live environment and tested all implemented features.\r\n3.) Verified the complete Admin Panel on the live environment and checked all completed modules and points.\r\n4.) Shared the latest project updates and completed task status with the client.\r\n5.) Attended a client meeting to discuss the current progress and the next phase of development.\r\n6.) Worked on connecting the live database and investigated the connection issue (still in progress).\r\n7.) Resolved the issue where the Vendor Profile was not updating', '09:30', '18:35', '09:05', 116),
(6252, '2026-08-04 00:00:00', '2026-08-04 14:09:45', 620, 'create banners and neural video', '09:41', '19:30', '09:49', 102),
(6253, '2026-08-04 00:00:00', '2026-08-04 17:14:08', 59, '1. Checked the live EventStan (Customer, Admin, and Vendor APIs) environment and found the server was down. Reported the issue in the team group.\r\n2. Connected the local EventStan database, seeded the data, and successfully ran the local EventStan Customer, Admin, and Vendor applications.\r\n3. Resolved all setup and runtime issues in the local environment.\r\n4. Prepared documentation for the required Customer Panel APIs and shared it with the team group.\r\n5. Created the Add to Cart sidebar.\r\n6. Updated the Add to Cart sidebar according to Base 44 requirements, designed the screen, and made it fully responsive.\r\n7. Attended the internal team meeting.', '09:34', '18:50', '09:16', 116);
